{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24847","headline":"游峡山寺 · 杨衡","name":"游峡山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结构天南畔，胜绝固难俦。\n幸蒙时所漏，遂得恣闲游。\n路石荫松盖，槛藤维鹤舟。\n雨霁花木润，风和景气柔。\n宝殿敞丹扉，灵幡垂绦旒。\n照曜芙蓉壶，金人居上头。\n翔禽拂危刹，落日避层楼。\n端溪弥漫驶，曲涧潺湲流。\n高居何重沓，登览自夷犹。\n烟霞无隐态，岩洞讵遗幽。\n奔驷非久耀，驰波肯暂留。\n会从香火缘，灭迹此山丘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}